WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.619
Set a reminder once a year, for example on your birthday,

2
00:00:03.863 --> 00:00:07.427
and go through ten questions with your policies in front of you.

3
00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:09.745
First, your life:

4
00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:11.696
has anything changed in the family?

5
00:00:11.882 --> 00:00:13.809
Has your job or income changed?

6
00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:17.640
Did you take out, pay off or refinance a loan?

7
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.796
Then your cover:

8
00:00:19.982 --> 00:00:22.570
are the beneficiaries the people you want today?

9
00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:25.914
Is the sum insured enough for the loans and the family’s needs?

10
00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.912
Do you know your health plan’s limit,

11
00:00:27.912 --> 00:00:30.128
its excess and what it does not cover?

12
00:00:30.373 --> 00:00:33.332
Is anything duplicated, or is there a gap?

13
00:00:34.432 --> 00:00:35.418
And costs:

14
00:00:35.605 --> 00:00:37.995
are the premiums still comfortable for your budget?

15
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.269
Have you kept the premium certificates for your tax return?

16
00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:43.116
Does someone close to you know where

17
00:00:43.116 --> 00:00:45.542
the policies are and whom to call?

18
00:00:46.642 --> 00:00:47.884
If you answered “no”

19
00:00:47.884 --> 00:00:48.674
or “I don’t know”

20
00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:50.948
to any question, a review is worth it.

21
00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.865
Bring your policies, and go through

22
00:00:52.865 --> 00:00:55.523
them with Giannis, with no commitment.

23
00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.095
For a first conversation with no commitment,

24
00:00:59.096 --> 00:01:02.880
call plus three five seven, nine seven, eight four zero,

25
00:01:02.904 --> 00:01:05.643
nine four one, or send a WhatsApp message.
